\begin{align*}
    a^2+b^2 &\geq 2ab 
    a^2-ab+b^2 &\geq ab 
    \frac{1}{a^2-ab+b^2} &\leq \frac{1}{ab}
\end{align*}
Multiplying  $a/3c$  both side and cyclically summing gives
\begin{align*}
    \sum_{\text{cyc}} \frac{a}{3c(a^2-ab+b^2)} &\leq \frac{1}{abc}\cdot \frac{a+b+c}{3} 
