draw((0,-2)--(1,-2)--(1,0)--(0,0)--cycle,gray);
draw((0,0)--(1,0)--(1,1)--(0,1)--cycle,green);
[/asy]

If the newly occupied area does not originally intersect any region  $R_{k+1}$ , then we end the sequences. Otherwise we can check from property  $P$  that  $c_{k+1}$  and  $R_{k+1}$  still satisfy one of the three cases.

