draw((0,-1)--(2,-1)--(0,1)--cycle,gray);
draw((0,0)--(1,0)--(1,1)--(0,1)--cycle,green);
[/asy]

Then we transform  $R_k$  in the following way, occupying the other half of a cell  $c_{k+1}$ .

[asy]
